!  * add additional vacuum components (pumps and gauges) per D. White
! ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
! 01-SEP-2022, M. Woodley
!  * add MARKERs at locations of Vertical Transfer Lines (VTL) per S. Kaminski
! ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
! 15-JUL-2022, M. Woodley
!  * rematch around dead QCM34
! 11-MAY-2022, M. Woodley
!  * prepend "cryo " to TYPE attribute for cryomodule quadrupoles per K. Luchini
! ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
! 09-NOV-2021, M. Woodley
!  * set LCAV TYPE attributes to cryomodule designations
!  * set QUAD TYPE attributes to cryomodule magnet package designations
! 20-OCT-2021, M. Woodley
!  * create "_full" definitions for 1.3 GHz and 3.9 GHz cavities to allow Bmad
!    to use field maps (L= 1.3 m for 1.3 GHz; L= 1.3/3 m for 3.9 GHz)
! ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
! 03-MAR-2021, M. Woodley
!  * use cryomodule designations in TYPE definitions for LCAVs, QUADs, XCORs,
!    and YCORs (add as comments to BPMs)
! ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
! 16-JAN-2021, M. Woodley
!  * new standard configuration per Y. Ding
! ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
! 02-NOV-2018, M. Woodley
!  * L0 gradients and phases from 100 pC ASTRA run, per C. Mayes
! ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
! 01-NOV-2017, M. Woodley
!  * change L2 phase to -20.0 degrees per P. Emma
! ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
! 04-NOV-2016, M. Woodley
!  * change cryo-quadrupole effective length from 0.29 m to 0.23 m
!  * change CM03-to-CMH1 interconnect dimensions per A. Dalesandro (FNAL)
!  * change from gate valve flange face callouts to mating surface callouts for
!    1.3 GHz cryomodules
!  * add beamline flanges
! ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
! 06-JUN-2016, M. Woodley
!  * move 1.3 GHz HOMs d/s 27.19 mm per Yun He (FNAL) ... maintain slot length
! 26-MAY-2016, M. Woodley
!  * 3.9 GHz layout update (18-May-2016) per Yun He (FNAL)
!  * put HOMs ("Beam Line Absorbers") back at the d/s end of L0, L2, and L3 per
!    C. Adolphsen email of 20-May-2016
! 11-MAY-2016, M. Woodley
!  * set L0 d/s MSC length to 1.829 m; locations of vacuum components (V*0H00)
!    per H.Alvarez
! 28-APR-2016, M. Woodley
!  * post-to-cap dimensions from SD-375-000-99-R2
! 22-APR-2016, M. Woodley
!  * add 1.1 mm to CM03-CMH1 interconnect
!  * add 3.47 mm to CMH1-CMH2 interconnect
!  * 3.9 GHz CM cold dimensions per Y. He (20-Apr-2016)
! 28-MAR-2016, M. Woodley
!  * add end cap and feed cap MARKers
! ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
! 14-MAR-2016, M. Woodley
!  * 3.9 GHz layout update per Yun He (FNAL)
! 02-FEB-2016, M. Woodley
!  * new 1.3 GHz layout per T. Peterson/J. Kaluzny (FNAL) [19-Nov-2015]
!  * new 3.9 GHz layout per T. Peterson (FNAL) [02-Dec-2015]
!  * feed cap, end cap, and stay-clear dimensions from drawing SD-375-000-99-R1
!  * remove last HOM in each linac section (L0/L1/L2/L3)
!  * adjust Differential Pumping Stay-Clears to restore locations of
!    LH/BC1/BC2/dogleg
!  * split 1.3 GHz cavity #5's to insert MARKer for center post
!  * remove BPM1C00/RFB1C00 (now that there are BPMs in the 3.9 GHz cryomodules)
! 01-FEB-2016, M. Woodley
!  * new 100 pC input beams from J. Qiang/C. Mitchell
! 01-NOV-2015, M. Woodley
!  * new 100 pC input beam from F. Zhou (Twiss from P. Emma)
! ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
! 01-OCT-2015, M. Woodley
!  * add vacuum components and fixed-aperture collimator in L0 downstream
!    mechanical-stay-clear space
!  * fix negative D2C00a drift length error by shortening DPSC2D drift
!  * add BEAM0 MARKer
! ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
! 19-JUN-2015, M. Woodley
!  * lengthen special L0 u/s end cap, per H.Alvarez ... moves gun u/s
!  * move ASTRA point to dZ=15.0 m from gun (temporarily)
!  * use QCM01 for matching
!  * undefer BPM1C00
! ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
! 20-MAR-2015, M. Woodley
!  * add APER definition for cryo-quads
! ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
! 12-DEC-2014, M. Woodley
!  * new FNAL 1.3 GHz cryomodule layout (F10010875) per M. Carrasco
!  * new end cap and mechanical stay-clear dimensions per H. Alvarez
!  * because mechanical stay-clear spaces got ~0.5 m longer, shorten
!    differential pumping spaces from 3.0 m to ~2.5 m to keep cryomodules in
!    previous Z-locations (checked with D. Gill)
!  * keep previous L3 vacuum break length (not designed yet)
!  * replace RFB1C00 (defer=2) with BPM1C00 (defer=0)
! ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
! 15-OCT-2014, M. Woodley
!  * new FNAL 3.9 GHz cryomodule layout (F10014857) via M. Carrasco ... assume
!    save interconnect and d/s end cap dimensions as 1.3 GHz cryomodule
!  * add 3.0 m differential pumping stay-clear after L0
!  * add RFB0H00 between L0 mechanical stay-clear and differential pumping
!    stay-clear
!  * adjust deferment/deprecation levels
! ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
! 07-AUG-2014, M. Woodley
!  * new cryomodule layout per FNAL folks via H. Alvarez
!  * L1 phase advance per FODO cell lowered to 45 degrees
!  * cryomodule BPMs will be button-type ... rename RFB* -> BPM*
!  * shorten 3.9 GHz CMs and remove QUAD/BPM/corrector packages
! ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
! 25-APR-2014, M. Woodley
!  * new cryomodule layout per FNAL folks via H. Alvarez
!  * add HOM absorber MARKERs (HOMCM*)
! ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
! 27-MAR-2014, M. Woodley
!  * all cryomodules now have standard Q/XC/YC/BPM package
!  * remove COUPLER MARKer points
!  * add CM34/CM35 energy feedback phase "kink"
!  * element names changed to conform to nomenclature PRD
! ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
! 19-FEB-2014, M. Woodley
!  * updated cryomodule layout
!  * 3.9 GHz linearizer is now 2 standard cryostats with 8 cavities each
! ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
! 07-JAN-2014, M. Woodley
!    Energy profile (CM01 amplitudes and phases) per P. Emma (20-DEC-2013)
! ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
! 30-OCT-2013, M. Woodley
!    LCLS2sc v1.2
! ------------------------------------------------------------------------------

! ==============================================================================
! LCAV
! ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
! CM01 (L0), CM02 (L1), and CM03 (L1) cavities have individual power sources
! ------------------------------------------------------------------------------

  Lambda := CLIGHT/1.3E+09 !1.3 GHz wavelength

  LcavL := 9*Lambda/2 !1.3 GHz cavity active length
  LcavR := 70e-3/2    !1.3 GHz cavity iris radius
  CcavL := LcavL/3    !3.9 GHz cavity active length
  CcavR := 30e-3/2    !3.9 GHz cavity iris radius

  Lcav52cp := 0.14035          !cavity #5 center to support post
  LcavLa   := LcavL/2+Lcav52cp !cavity #5 length u/s of support post
  LcavLb   := LcavL-LcavLa     !cavity #5 length d/s of support post

  Ccav22cp := 0.11262          !support post to cavity #2 center
  CcavLa   := CcavL/2-Ccav22cp !cavity #2 length u/s of support post
  CcavLb   := CcavL-CcavLa     !cavity #2 length d/s of support post
  
  FracL0 := 0.836061812062 !Ei=75 MeV
  AmplL1 := 231.0 !MV
  FracL1 := 1.047533331879 !E1=250 MeV
  GradL1 := FracL1*AmplL1/(2*8*LcavL) !MV/m (2 8-cavity CM's)
  PhasL1 := -24.9 !degrees
  AHcav  := 60.0 !MV
  GHcav  := AHcav/(2*8*CcavL) !MV/m (2 8-cavity CM's)
  PHcav  := -172.5 !degrees
  AmplL2 := 1479.0 !MV
  FracL2 := 1.011884846424 !E2=1.500 GeV
  GradL2 := FracL2*AmplL2/(12*8*LcavL) !MV/m (12 8-cavity CM's)
  PhasL2 := -32.3 !degrees
  AmplL3 := 2500.0 !MV
  FracL3 := 1.0 !Ef=4.000 GeV
  GradL3 := FracL3*AmplL3/(20*8*LcavL) !MV/m (20 8-cavity CM's)
  PhasL3 := 0.0

 !VALUE, 100*(1-FracL1),100*(1-FracL2),100*(1-FracL3)

! Cavity amplitudes (MV)

  A011 :=  6.5
  A012 :=  0.0
  A013 :=  9.7
  A014 :=  5.0
  A015 := 13.0*FracL0
  A016 := 16.6*FracL0
  A017 := 16.6*FracL0
  A018 := 16.6*FracL0
  
! Cavity phases (deg) ... all on-crest

  P011 := 0
  P012 := 0 
  P013 := 0
  P014 := 0
  P015 := 0
  P016 := 0
  P017 := 0
  P018 := 0

  CAVL011  : LCAV, SWAVE, FREQ=1300, L=LcavL, APER=LcavR, TYPE="F1.3-19", &
                   DELTAE=A011, PHI0=P011/360
  CAVL012  : LCAV, SWAVE, FREQ=1300, L=LcavL, APER=LcavR, TYPE="F1.3-19", &
                   DELTAE=A012, PHI0=P012/360
  CAVL013  : LCAV, SWAVE, FREQ=1300, L=LcavL, APER=LcavR, TYPE="F1.3-19", &
                   DELTAE=A013, PHI0=P013/360
  CAVL014  : LCAV, SWAVE, FREQ=1300, L=LcavL, APER=LcavR, TYPE="F1.3-19", &
                   DELTAE=A014, PHI0=P014/360
  CAVL015a : LCAV, SWAVE, FREQ=1300, L=LcavLa, APER=LcavR, TYPE="F1.3-19", &
                   DELTAE=A015*(LcavLa/LcavL), PHI0=P015/360
  CAVL015b : LCAV, SWAVE, FREQ=1300, L=LcavLb, APER=LcavR, TYPE="F1.3-19", &
                   DELTAE=A015*(LcavLb/LcavL), PHI0=P015/360
  CAVL016  : LCAV, SWAVE, FREQ=1300, L=LcavL, APER=LcavR, TYPE="F1.3-19", &
                   DELTAE=A016, PHI0=P016/360
  CAVL017  : LCAV, SWAVE, FREQ=1300, L=LcavL, APER=LcavR, TYPE="F1.3-19", &
                   DELTAE=A017, PHI0=P017/360
  CAVL018  : LCAV, SWAVE, FREQ=1300, L=LcavL, APER=LcavR, TYPE="F1.3-19", &
                   DELTAE=A018, PHI0=P018/360

! L1

  G021 := GradL1 ; P021 := PhasL1
  G022 := GradL1 ; P022 := PhasL1
  G023 := GradL1 ; P023 := PhasL1
  G024 := GradL1 ; P024 := PhasL1
  G025 := GradL1 ; P025 := PhasL1
  G026 := GradL1 ; P026 := PhasL1
  G027 := GradL1 ; P027 := PhasL1
  G028 := GradL1 ; P028 := PhasL1

  CAVL021  : LCAV, SWAVE, FREQ=1300, L=LcavL, APER=LcavR, TYPE="J1.3-21", &
                   DELTAE=G021*LcavL, PHI0=P021/360
  CAVL022  : LCAV, SWAVE, FREQ=1300, L=LcavL, APER=LcavR, TYPE="J1.3-21", &
                   DELTAE=G022*LcavL, PHI0=P022/360
  CAVL023  : LCAV, SWAVE, FREQ=1300, L=LcavL, APER=LcavR, TYPE="J1.3-21", &
                   DELTAE=G023*LcavL, PHI0=P023/360
  CAVL024  : LCAV, SWAVE, FREQ=1300, L=LcavL, APER=LcavR, TYPE="J1.3-21", &
                   DELTAE=G024*LcavL, PHI0=P024/360
  CAVL025a : LCAV, SWAVE, FREQ=1300, L=LcavLa, APER=LcavR, TYPE="J1.3-21", &
                   DELTAE=G025*LcavLa, PHI0=P025/360
  CAVL025b : LCAV, SWAVE, FREQ=1300, L=LcavLb, APER=LcavR, TYPE="J1.3-21", &
                   DELTAE=G025*LcavLb, PHI0=P025/360
  CAVL026  : LCAV, SWAVE, FREQ=1300, L=LcavL, APER=LcavR, TYPE="J1.3-21", &
                   DELTAE=G026*LcavL, PHI0=P026/360
  CAVL027  : LCAV, SWAVE, FREQ=1300, L=LcavL, APER=LcavR, TYPE="J1.3-21", &
                   DELTAE=G027*LcavL, PHI0=P027/360
  CAVL028  : LCAV, SWAVE, FREQ=1300, L=LcavL, APER=LcavR, TYPE="J1.3-21", &
                   DELTAE=G028*LcavL, PHI0=P028/360

  G031 := GradL1 ; P031 := PhasL1
  G032 := GradL1 ; P032 := PhasL1
  G033 := GradL1 ; P033 := PhasL1
  G034 := GradL1 ; P034 := PhasL1
  G035 := GradL1 ; P035 := PhasL1
  G036 := GradL1 ; P036 := PhasL1
  G037 := GradL1 ; P037 := PhasL1
  G038 := GradL1 ; P038 := PhasL1

  CAVL031  : LCAV, SWAVE, FREQ=1300, L=LcavL, APER=LcavR, TYPE="J1.3-20", &
                   DELTAE=G031*LcavL, PHI0=P031/360
  CAVL032  : LCAV, SWAVE, FREQ=1300, L=LcavL, APER=LcavR, TYPE="J1.3-20", &
                   DELTAE=G032*LcavL, PHI0=P032/360
  CAVL033  : LCAV, SWAVE, FREQ=1300, L=LcavL, APER=LcavR, TYPE="J1.3-20", &
                   DELTAE=G033*LcavL, PHI0=P033/360
  CAVL034  : LCAV, SWAVE, FREQ=1300, L=LcavL, APER=LcavR, TYPE="J1.3-20", &
                   DELTAE=G034*LcavL, PHI0=P034/360
  CAVL035a : LCAV, SWAVE, FREQ=1300, L=LcavLa, APER=LcavR, TYPE="J1.3-20", &
                   DELTAE=G035*LcavLa, PHI0=P035/360
  CAVL035b : LCAV, SWAVE, FREQ=1300, L=LcavLb, APER=LcavR, TYPE="J1.3-20", &
                   DELTAE=G035*LcavLb, PHI0=P035/360
  CAVL036  : LCAV, SWAVE, FREQ=1300, L=LcavL, APER=LcavR, TYPE="J1.3-20", &
                   DELTAE=G036*LcavL, PHI0=P036/360
  CAVL037  : LCAV, SWAVE, FREQ=1300, L=LcavL, APER=LcavR, TYPE="J1.3-20", &
                   DELTAE=G037*LcavL, PHI0=P037/360
  CAVL038  : LCAV, SWAVE, FREQ=1300, L=LcavL, APER=LcavR, TYPE="J1.3-20", &
                   DELTAE=G038*LcavL, PHI0=P038/360

! 3rd harmonic linearizer

  CAVC011  : LCAV, SWAVE, FREQ=3900, L=CcavL, APER=CcavR, TYPE="F3.9-01", &
                   DELTAE=GHcav*CcavL, PHI0=PHcav/360
  CAVC012a : LCAV, SWAVE, FREQ=3900, L=CcavLa, APER=CcavR, TYPE="F3.9-01", &
                   DELTAE=GHcav*CcavLa, PHI0=PHcav/360
  CAVC012b : LCAV, SWAVE, FREQ=3900, L=CcavLb, APER=CcavR, TYPE="F3.9-01", &
                   DELTAE=GHcav*CcavLb, PHI0=PHcav/360
  CAVC013  : LCAV, SWAVE, FREQ=3900, L=CcavL, APER=CcavR, TYPE="F3.9-01", &
                   DELTAE=GHcav*CcavL, PHI0=PHcav/360
  CAVC014  : LCAV, SWAVE, FREQ=3900, L=CcavL, APER=CcavR, TYPE="F3.9-01", &
                   DELTAE=GHcav*CcavL, PHI0=PHcav/360
  CAVC015  : LCAV, SWAVE, FREQ=3900, L=CcavL, APER=CcavR, TYPE="F3.9-01", &
                   DELTAE=GHcav*CcavL, PHI0=PHcav/360
  CAVC016  : LCAV, SWAVE, FREQ=3900, L=CcavL, APER=CcavR, TYPE="F3.9-01", &
                   DELTAE=GHcav*CcavL, PHI0=PHcav/360
  CAVC017  : LCAV, SWAVE, FREQ=3900, L=CcavL, APER=CcavR, TYPE="F3.9-01", &
                   DELTAE=GHcav*CcavL, PHI0=PHcav/360
  CAVC018  : LCAV, SWAVE, FREQ=3900, L=CcavL, APER=CcavR, TYPE="F3.9-01", &
                   DELTAE=GHcav*CcavL, PHI0=PHcav/360

  CAVC021  : LCAV, SWAVE, FREQ=3900, L=CcavL, APER=CcavR, TYPE="F3.9-02", &
                   DELTAE=GHcav*CcavL, PHI0=PHcav/360
  CAVC022a : LCAV, SWAVE, FREQ=3900, L=CcavLa, APER=CcavR, TYPE="F3.9-02", &
                   DELTAE=GHcav*CcavLa, PHI0=PHcav/360
  CAVC022b : LCAV, SWAVE, FREQ=3900, L=CcavLb, APER=CcavR, TYPE="F3.9-02", &
                   DELTAE=GHcav*CcavLb, PHI0=PHcav/360
  CAVC023  : LCAV, SWAVE, FREQ=3900, L=CcavL, APER=CcavR, TYPE="F3.9-02", &
                   DELTAE=GHcav*CcavL, PHI0=PHcav/360
  CAVC024  : LCAV, SWAVE, FREQ=3900, L=CcavL, APER=CcavR, TYPE="F3.9-02", &
                   DELTAE=GHcav*CcavL, PHI0=PHcav/360
  CAVC025  : LCAV, SWAVE, FREQ=3900, L=CcavL, APER=CcavR, TYPE="F3.9-02", &
                   DELTAE=GHcav*CcavL, PHI0=PHcav/360
  CAVC026  : LCAV, SWAVE, FREQ=3900, L=CcavL, APER=CcavR, TYPE="F3.9-02", &
                   DELTAE=GHcav*CcavL, PHI0=PHcav/360
  CAVC027  : LCAV, SWAVE, FREQ=3900, L=CcavL, APER=CcavR, TYPE="F3.9-02", &
                   DELTAE=GHcav*CcavL, PHI0=PHcav/360
  CAVC028  : LCAV, SWAVE, FREQ=3900, L=CcavL, APER=CcavR, TYPE="F3.9-02", &
                   DELTAE=GHcav*CcavL, PHI0=PHcav/360

! L2

  CAVL041  : LCAV, SWAVE, FREQ=1300, L=LcavL, APER=LcavR, TYPE="F1.3-07", &
                   DELTAE=GradL2*LcavL, PHI0=PhasL2/360
  CAVL042  : LCAV, SWAVE, FREQ=1300, L=LcavL, APER=LcavR, TYPE="F1.3-07", &
                   DELTAE=GradL2*LcavL, PHI0=PhasL2/360
  CAVL043  : LCAV, SWAVE, FREQ=1300, L=LcavL, APER=LcavR, TYPE="F1.3-07", &
                   DELTAE=GradL2*LcavL, PHI0=PhasL2/360
  CAVL044  : LCAV, SWAVE, FREQ=1300, L=LcavL, APER=LcavR, TYPE="F1.3-07", &
                   DELTAE=GradL2*LcavL, PHI0=PhasL2/360
  CAVL045a : LCAV, SWAVE, FREQ=1300, L=LcavLa, APER=LcavR, TYPE="F1.3-07", &
                   DELTAE=GradL2*LcavLa, PHI0=PhasL2/360
  CAVL045b : LCAV, SWAVE, FREQ=1300, L=LcavLb, APER=LcavR, TYPE="F1.3-07", &
                   DELTAE=GradL2*LcavLb, PHI0=PhasL2/360
  CAVL046  : LCAV, SWAVE, FREQ=1300, L=LcavL, APER=LcavR, TYPE="F1.3-07", &
                   DELTAE=GradL2*LcavL, PHI0=PhasL2/360
  CAVL047  : LCAV, SWAVE, FREQ=1300, L=LcavL, APER=LcavR, TYPE="F1.3-07", &
                   DELTAE=GradL2*LcavL, PHI0=PhasL2/360
  CAVL048  : LCAV, SWAVE, FREQ=1300, L=LcavL, APER=LcavR, TYPE="F1.3-07", &
                   DELTAE=GradL2*LcavL, PHI0=PhasL2/360

  CAVL051  : LCAV, SWAVE, FREQ=1300, L=LcavL, APER=LcavR, TYPE="J1.3-04", &
                   DELTAE=GradL2*LcavL, PHI0=PhasL2/360
  CAVL052  : LCAV, SWAVE, FREQ=1300, L=LcavL, APER=LcavR, TYPE="J1.3-04", &
                   DELTAE=GradL2*LcavL, PHI0=PhasL2/360
  CAVL053  : LCAV, SWAVE, FREQ=1300, L=LcavL, APER=LcavR, TYPE="J1.3-04", &
                   DELTAE=GradL2*LcavL, PHI0=PhasL2/360
  CAVL054  : LCAV, SWAVE, FREQ=1300, L=LcavL, APER=LcavR, TYPE="J1.3-04", &
                   DELTAE=GradL2*LcavL, PHI0=PhasL2/360
  CAVL055a : LCAV, SWAVE, FREQ=1300, L=LcavLa, APER=LcavR, TYPE="J1.3-04", &
                   DELTAE=GradL2*LcavLa, PHI0=PhasL2/360
  CAVL055b : LCAV, SWAVE, FREQ=1300, L=LcavLb, APER=LcavR, TYPE="J1.3-04", &
                   DELTAE=GradL2*LcavLb, PHI0=PhasL2/360
  CAVL056  : LCAV, SWAVE, FREQ=1300, L=LcavL, APER=LcavR, TYPE="J1.3-04", &
                   DELTAE=GradL2*LcavL, PHI0=PhasL2/360
  CAVL057  : LCAV, SWAVE, FREQ=1300, L=LcavL, APER=LcavR, TYPE="J1.3-04", &
                   DELTAE=GradL2*LcavL, PHI0=PhasL2/360
  CAVL058  : LCAV, SWAVE, FREQ=1300, L=LcavL, APER=LcavR, TYPE="J1.3-04", &
                   DELTAE=GradL2*LcavL, PHI0=PhasL2/360

  CAVL061  : LCAV, SWAVE, FREQ=1300, L=LcavL, APER=LcavR, TYPE="F1.3-08", &
                   DELTAE=GradL2*LcavL, PHI0=PhasL2/360
  CAVL062  : LCAV, SWAVE, FREQ=1300, L=LcavL, APER=LcavR, TYPE="F1.3-08", &
                   DELTAE=GradL2*LcavL, PHI0=PhasL2/360
  CAVL063  : LCAV, SWAVE, FREQ=1300, L=LcavL, APER=LcavR, TYPE="F1.3-08", &
                   DELTAE=GradL2*LcavL, PHI0=PhasL2/360
  CAVL064  : LCAV, SWAVE, FREQ=1300, L=LcavL, APER=LcavR, TYPE="F1.3-08", &
                   DELTAE=GradL2*LcavL, PHI0=PhasL2/360
  CAVL065a : LCAV, SWAVE, FREQ=1300, L=LcavLa, APER=LcavR, TYPE="F1.3-08", &
                   DELTAE=GradL2*LcavLa, PHI0=PhasL2/360
  CAVL065b : LCAV, SWAVE, FREQ=1300, L=LcavLb, APER=LcavR, TYPE="F1.3-08", &
                   DELTAE=GradL2*LcavLb, PHI0=PhasL2/360
